---------------------------------------------------------------------------
A note on the GitHub Pages demo build
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The self-hosted build (`npm run build`) serves every component above from
its own origin and makes no network requests at runtime. The demo build
(`npm run build:github`) instead loads the GLiNER model from Hugging Face
and the OCR assets from jsDelivr on first use, because the 580MB model
cannot be hosted on GitHub Pages. Documents are never sent anywhere in
either build; only the model download touches the network. See the
Content-Security-Policy in the built index.html, which states exactly which
origins each build is permitted to contact.
